    'Absent': '缺席', 'reason unknown': '原因不明', 'Here': '到課人數', 'Has a note': '有備註', '. Open the day and press “Absent, excused” when you hear why.': '。得知原因後，請開啟那一天並按「缺席，已請假」。', 'Email wording…': '電子郵件內容…', 'Copy list': '複製清單', 'Every student who owes work, with their email and what they owe, to paste into a spreadsheet': '每位缺交的學生，連同電子郵件和缺交項目，可貼到試算表',
