    'Nobody owes any work this year.': '本學年沒有人缺交作業。', 'Nobody owes any work in this term.': '這個學期沒有人缺交作業。', 'When you mark a paper Missing, on the marking screen or in the gradebook, it shows here.': '在批改畫面或成績冊把作業標記為缺交後，就會顯示在這裡。', 'When you mark a paper Missing, on the marking screen or in the gradebook, it shows here. Whole year shows every term.': '在批改畫面或成績冊把作業標記為缺交後，就會顯示在這裡。「整個學年」會顯示所有學期。',
    'One email to all of them, each address hidden from the others (Bcc)': '寄一封信給所有人，彼此看不到對方的地址（密件副本）', 'Email all': '寄給所有人', 'Copy': '複製', 'The email as text, to paste anywhere': '電子郵件的文字，可貼到任何地方', 'Email reminder': '寄提醒信', 'You opened a reminder about this': '你已開啟過這項的提醒信',
