    'Rows': '排', 'Pairs': '兩人一組', 'Tables of four': '四人一桌', 'Horseshoe': '馬蹄形', 'Single desks in rows': '單人課桌排成一排排', 'Desks side by side in twos': '課桌兩兩並排', 'Four desks pushed together': '四張課桌併在一起', 'Desks around three sides, open to the front': '課桌排在三邊，面向前方開口',
