    'Take off the chart': '從座位表移除', 'Not seated': '未入座', 'Everyone has a seat.': '所有人都有座位。', 'Drag a student to a desk, or click the student and then the desk. Dropping one student on another swaps them. Drag someone here to take them off the chart.': '把學生拖到課桌上，或先按學生再按課桌。把一位學生放到另一位身上會互換座位。拖到這裡可從座位表移除。',
    'Stays here when the class is shuffled': '全班隨機換位時會留在這裡', 'Empty desk': '空課桌', 'No desk. Click to put one here': '沒有課桌。按一下可在這裡放一張', 'Desk. Click to take it away': '課桌。按一下可拿掉', 'Each point adds one percentage point to the term grade. Leave a student blank for none. It doesn’t change any assignment’s score.': '每一分會讓學期成績增加一個百分點。不加分的學生請留白。不會改變任何作業的分數。',
