    'Right now your marking lives only in this browser, and clearing the browser’s data would erase it. Choose a folder on this computer once. Every save then goes there too, with a copy of each day to go back to. Nothing is uploaded.': '目前你的批改只存在這個瀏覽器，清除瀏覽器資料就會消失。只要選一次這台電腦上的資料夾，之後每次儲存也會存到那裡，並保留每天的副本，方便回復。不會上傳任何資料。',
    'Choose a folder…': '選擇資料夾…', 'Not now': '暫時不要', 'Already have a Grading Studio folder? Choose it and your work comes back.': '已經有 Grading Studio 資料夾了嗎？選擇它，你的工作成果就會回來。',
    'It lives only in this browser, and clearing the browser’s data would erase it. This browser can’t save to a folder by itself: Chrome or Edge on a computer can. Here, make a take-home file when you finish marking.': '它只存在這個瀏覽器，清除瀏覽器資料就會消失。這個瀏覽器無法自行存到資料夾，電腦上的 Chrome 或 Edge 才可以。在這裡，批改完請製作一個攜帶檔。',
