    /* the welcome */
    'Mark papers, plan lessons,': '批改作業、規劃課程、', 'hand work back.': '發還作業。',
    'Three quick questions and you’re marking. You can change every answer later.': '回答三個簡單的問題就能開始批改。每個答案之後都可以更改。',
    'Your classes': '你的班級', 'How you grade': '評分方式', 'Where work is kept': '儲存位置',
    'What do you teach?': '你教哪些班級？', 'A class, like Period 2 Biology': '一個班級，例如「第二節 生物」', 'Another class': '另一個班級', 'Add another class': '再新增一個班級',
    'Student names are optional and come later: paste a class list on a class’s page, or skip it.': '學生姓名可以之後再加，也可以不加：在班級頁面貼上名單，或直接略過。',
    'Where do students hand in work?': '學生在哪裡繳交作業？', 'On paper, or I’d rather not say': '紙本，或不想說明', 'Somewhere else…': '其他地方…',
    'Its name': '名稱', 'The name of your school’s system': '學校系統的名稱',
    'Only so the app can use its name. Nothing is connected to it, and nothing is sent.': '只是為了讓介面顯示它的名稱。不會與它連線，也不會傳送任何資料。',
    'How do you usually grade?': '你通常怎麼評分？',
    'Rubric rows': '評分規準項目', 'Score each row 0 to 4, half points too. The total and percent add up by themselves.': '每個項目評 0 到 4 分，也可以給半分。總分和百分比會自動計算。',
    'Points': '分數', 'Type a total, like 17 out of 20. Each assignment has its own “out of”.': '輸入總分，例如滿分 20 得 17。每份作業有自己的滿分。',
    'Percent': '百分比', 'Type a percent for each paper.': '為每份作業輸入百分比。',
    'Letter grades': '等第', 'A to F, worked out from the percent. You set where each letter starts.': 'A 到 F，依百分比換算。每個等第的起點由你設定。',
    'IB DP 1 to 7': 'IB DP 1 到 7', 'A final grade of 1 to 7, worked out from the percent, as in the Diploma. You set the boundaries for your subject.': '最終成績 1 到 7，依百分比換算，如同 DP。各級的分界由你依科目設定。',
    'IB MYP criteria': 'IB MYP 評量標準', 'Each criterion is marked 0 to 8. You choose the level that fits best, and the total becomes a final grade of 1 to 7.': '每項標準評 0 到 8。由你選出最符合的等級，總分再換算成 1 到 7 的最終成績。',
    'This is only what a new assignment starts with. Any assignment can be scored another way.': '這只是新作業的預設方式。任何作業都可以改用其他方式評分。',
    'Where should your work be kept?': '工作成果要存在哪裡？',
    'Your classes, papers, marks and scores are kept in this browser. Choose a folder on this computer and every save goes there too, with a copy of each day to go back to. Nothing is uploaded.': '你的班級、作業、批註和分數都存在這個瀏覽器。選擇這台電腦上的資料夾，之後每次儲存也會存到那裡，並保留每天的副本，方便回復。不會上傳任何資料。',
    'You can also do this later, from the sidebar.': '也可以之後再從側邊欄設定。',
    'Your classes, papers, marks and scores are kept in this browser. This browser can’t save to a folder by itself (Chrome or Edge on a computer can), so make a take-home file now and then, in Settings. The sidebar reminds you.': '你的班級、作業、批註和分數都存在這個瀏覽器。這個瀏覽器無法自行存到資料夾（電腦上的 Chrome 或 Edge 才可以），所以請不時到設定製作攜帶檔。側邊欄會提醒你。',
