    'A language other than English covers these screens so far: the sidebar, Today, the welcome, Settings, a class page with all its tabs, Help and the feedback page students get. The other screens are still in English. The translations have not yet been checked by fluent speakers, so a line may read oddly.': '英文以外的語言目前涵蓋最先看到的畫面：側邊欄、今天、歡迎畫面、設定、班級頁面及其所有分頁、說明，以及學生收到的回饋頁。其他畫面仍是英文。翻譯尚未經母語人士檢查，所以有些句子讀起來可能不太自然。',
